{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"PHASE 5 — MCP client scoping (ticket irregular-basic-bubblefish): codex startup failure RCA'd — valid PAT but GUI-launched processes never source ~/.zshenv, so bearer env var absent -> server 401 -> codex renders 'not logged in'. Fixes: launchctl setenv publishing in refresh-mcp-pats.sh (all PAT vars); operator ruled claude+copilot consolidate onto MCP_CLIENT_PAT_CLI (claude slot), codex keeps its own; project scoping via tracked .mcp.json (claude project scope + copilot >=1.0.83 workspace config, precedence verified empirically) and .codex/config.toml [mcp_servers.rebar]; global entries removed after merge. Verified: copilot loads .mcp.json first-found over .github/mcp.json; workspace overrides user config."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788999637516343001,"uuid":"c6d486b9-f908-4019-998b-0632a12dbe2f"}